	(text "SW2 -> IO0..IO3 (IO2 la chan strap: R5 keo len, cong tac khong noi GND nen luon o muc 1 khi khoi dong).\nFirmware quet ca 4 chan (lan luot keo 1 chan xuong 0, doc 3 chan con lai, bat pull-up noi).\nNac = so thu tu chan lon nhat trong cap dang noi - 1  ->  1, 2 hoac 3 endpoint Matter.\nKhong phu thuoc chan chung cua tung loai cong tac SP3T 4 chan." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 147.32 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "896e1856-1725-5e26-826e-aed9fe73925c"))
